<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">The International Monetary Fund has increa=
sed its growth forecast for the UK this year, but has said that it expects =
a modest slowdown in 2027 as higher energy prices take effect.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">The upgrade will be welcome news for the c=
hancellor, John Healey, who will arrive in Bangkok later this week to atten=
d the IMF=E2=80=99s annual meetings for the first time.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">The IMF, which publishes its World Economi=
c Outlook twice a year, has predicted GDP growth of 1.3% for the UK this ye=
ar =E2=80=93 up 0.3 percentage points from its most recent update in July.<=
/p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">However, the IMF also warned that high oil=
 prices and rising interest rates meant growth was likely to =E2=80=9Cedge =
down=E2=80=9D in 2027, =E2=80=9Cas higher energy prices and long-term inter=
est rates weigh on consumption and investment=E2=80=9D.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">It cut its UK growth forecast for next yea=
r modestly to 1.2%, from 1.3%.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">The IMF singled out the UK as among the co=
untries where core inflation =E2=80=93 which excludes volatile commodities =
such as energy =E2=80=93 is not expected to return to the 2% target until l=
ate next year.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">It expects average inflation in the UK to =
be 3.3% this year, and to remain at 2.8% in 2027 =E2=80=93 a challenge for =
Healey and the prime minister, Andy Burnham, who are promising to offer vot=
ers a =E2=80=9Cbreathing space=E2=80=9D from rising costs.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">It comes just weeks before Healey=E2=80=99=
s first budget on 28 October. He is expected to focus on plans to devolve m=
ore tax revenues to mayoralties, as well as measures to help households cop=
e with higher energy bills ahead of the winter.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">The Institute for Fiscal Studies warned th=
is week that the budget would be a <a href=3D"https://ablink.editorial.theg=
uardian.com/ss/c/u001.Yw_JkLMEmFuifc_XG18IRyTNtZQ7fIEMgszcCSneHEAsxWg7d8sWy=
